WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.260 --> 00:00:02.080
Hank: Good morning John, it's Monday!

00:00:02.080 --> 00:00:05.180
Katherine and I are in the San Juan Islands
for our fifth...

00:00:05.180 --> 00:00:06.180
year... anniversary.

00:00:06.180 --> 00:00:07.180
C'mere.

00:00:07.180 --> 00:00:09.650
Katherine: Y'wanna... bring my chair, or just
come over there?

00:00:09.650 --> 00:00:13.090
Hank: You can bring my - you can bring your
chair.

00:00:13.090 --> 00:00:15.240
We are on our fifth year anniversary vacation.

00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:16.340
Katherine: Yes, we are.

00:00:16.340 --> 00:00:19.030
H: It's been five years that we've been married.

00:00:19.030 --> 00:00:20.030
K: Mm-hmm.

00:00:20.030 --> 00:00:21.030
H: What do you think?

00:00:21.030 --> 00:00:22.030
K: I could do it for another five at least.

00:00:22.030 --> 00:00:23.030
H: So she's in for another five, folks.

00:00:23.030 --> 00:00:24.030
K: At least five.

00:00:24.030 --> 00:00:25.030
H: I don't think that's how marriage works.

00:00:25.030 --> 00:00:26.481
K: Come - come - come ask me again.

00:00:26.481 --> 00:00:27.550
H: In another five years?

00:00:27.550 --> 00:00:28.550
K: Yeah.

00:00:28.550 --> 00:00:29.550
H: Where are we?

00:00:29.550 --> 00:00:31.110
K: Ah, we are in Washington State.

00:00:31.110 --> 00:00:32.169
H: Yep.

00:00:32.169 --> 00:00:34.070
K: On San Juan Island.

00:00:34.070 --> 00:00:35.070
H: This is -

00:00:35.070 --> 00:00:36.070
K: Why are you petting me?

00:00:36.070 --> 00:00:37.070
H: I love you.

00:00:37.070 --> 00:00:38.070
It's an nice - it's a nice place for staying,
though, right?

00:00:38.070 --> 00:00:39.070
K: Do it again.

00:00:39.070 --> 00:00:40.070
H: Ooooaaaaahhhh, hahahaha.

00:00:40.070 --> 00:00:41.649
I wanna show everybody something.

00:00:41.649 --> 00:00:44.370
K: He's gone.

00:00:44.370 --> 00:00:50.929
Oh, this is - in - this is indicative of how
nice the place we're staying is.

00:00:50.929 --> 00:00:52.340
H: This is how - this - this is how you know
how, how, how nice a place is.

00:00:52.340 --> 00:00:53.760
K: This is the toilet bowl brush.

00:00:53.760 --> 00:00:55.999
H: If it were to talk, what would it sound
like?

00:00:55.999 --> 00:00:56.999
K: Oh, I don't know.

00:00:56.999 --> 00:01:01.589
I don't know what a toilet brush says, there
-

00:01:01.589 --> 00:01:02.589
H: Helloooooooo!

00:01:02.589 --> 00:01:04.600
I clean the loo!

00:01:04.600 --> 00:01:05.600
K: Euaaahhh!

00:01:05.600 --> 00:01:07.600
What's wrong with you?

00:01:07.600 --> 00:01:08.600
Nooooo!

00:01:08.600 --> 00:01:10.720
H: When we got married, what did you think
of me?

00:01:10.720 --> 00:01:11.720
Has it changed?

00:01:11.720 --> 00:01:12.720
K: No.

00:01:12.720 --> 00:01:13.720
H: No?

00:01:13.720 --> 00:01:17.330
K: I mean, we were - we had, we had, we'd
dated for a long time before we got married,

00:01:17.330 --> 00:01:20.050
so, y'know, I had a pretty formed opinion
of you.

00:01:20.050 --> 00:01:21.270
H: What do you think about nerdfighteria?

00:01:21.270 --> 00:01:22.270
K: Appreciative...

00:01:22.270 --> 00:01:26.000
H: You also want me to have more time... in
my life.

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:29.250
K: I love hanging out with you; that's like,
my favorite thing to do.

00:01:29.250 --> 00:01:30.250
H: Aw.

00:01:30.250 --> 00:01:31.250
So you're jealous of them.

00:01:31.250 --> 00:01:32.250
K: A little bit jealous.

00:01:32.250 --> 00:01:33.250
Sometimes.

00:01:33.250 --> 00:01:35.710
H: Are you enjoying Hankgames?

00:01:35.710 --> 00:01:38.190
K: Yeah, it's really fun.

00:01:38.190 --> 00:01:40.770
And I love going back and watching them, and
seeing, like -

00:01:40.770 --> 00:01:41.770
H: Oh! we had fun!

00:01:41.770 --> 00:01:43.120
K: - the stupid jokes we made.

00:01:43.120 --> 00:01:47.220
I never was, like, a person who played video
games by myself.

00:01:47.220 --> 00:01:49.990
Even when I was growing up, when we had like
NES...

00:01:49.990 --> 00:01:50.990
H: Yeah.

00:01:50.990 --> 00:01:54.780
K: ...it was most fun when my friends would
come over and we would play Battletoads.

00:01:54.780 --> 00:01:55.780
H: It's a social thing, yeah.

00:01:55.780 --> 00:01:59.560
It's now to the point where there are games
when you can play multiplayer that you can't

00:01:59.560 --> 00:02:03.210
play local multiplayer, you have to play it
online.

00:02:03.210 --> 00:02:04.740
K: Yeah that's sad.

00:02:04.740 --> 00:02:05.740
H: That's sad to me.

00:02:05.740 --> 00:02:08.769
Even watching other people, like even watching
Melissa play Ocarina of Time.

00:02:08.769 --> 00:02:09.769
K: Or Pikmin.

00:02:09.769 --> 00:02:10.769
H: Or Pikmin, yeah!

00:02:10.769 --> 00:02:11.769
K: What a good world.

00:02:11.769 --> 00:02:12.769
I like that little world.

00:02:12.769 --> 00:02:13.769
H: Mmhm.

00:02:13.769 --> 00:02:16.209
Them happy little guys dying for you.

00:02:16.209 --> 00:02:18.889
K: Yeah, they just decide that they really
like you and follow you around.

00:02:18.889 --> 00:02:19.889
"Throw me at a thing!"

00:02:19.889 --> 00:02:20.889
They just needed a leader.

00:02:20.889 --> 00:02:22.520
(fog horn blares outside)

00:02:22.520 --> 00:02:23.520
K: Oh!

00:02:23.520 --> 00:02:24.830
Both: A ferry!

00:02:24.830 --> 00:02:27.349
H: What do you think about ferries?

00:02:27.349 --> 00:02:28.630
K: I don't believe.

00:02:28.630 --> 00:02:30.660
H: You don't believe in ferries?

00:02:30.660 --> 00:02:31.660
Ohhhh!

00:02:31.660 --> 00:02:33.410
She doesn't believe in fairies!

00:02:33.410 --> 00:02:34.569
What about slugs?

00:02:34.569 --> 00:02:36.139
K: Oh, I like slugs.

00:02:36.139 --> 00:02:38.349
I didn't know that I liked slugs.

00:02:38.349 --> 00:02:39.349
H: We, yeah.

00:02:39.349 --> 00:02:41.599
K: I hate like the tiny little garden slugs.

00:02:41.599 --> 00:02:42.599
H: Slimy.

00:02:42.599 --> 00:02:45.689
K: Lemon will lay down in the grass and she'll
stand up and there'll be like nine slugs on

00:02:45.689 --> 00:02:46.689
her legs.

00:02:46.689 --> 00:02:49.180
H: But in Washington, there's like these HUGE...

00:02:49.180 --> 00:02:50.670
I'll put video of them over this.

00:02:50.670 --> 00:02:54.159
K: Well, we didn't even see like the big banana
slugs.

00:02:54.159 --> 00:02:55.159
H: Banana slugs.

00:02:55.159 --> 00:02:56.159
And you were like stroking it.

00:02:56.159 --> 00:02:57.159
K: They're so cool!

00:02:57.159 --> 00:02:58.890
H: Yeah, and it was like changing shape.

00:02:58.890 --> 00:02:59.890
K: Yeah!

00:02:59.890 --> 00:03:00.890
H: It was like a Transformer.

00:03:00.890 --> 00:03:02.569
K: It's got these different body shapes - parts.

00:03:02.569 --> 00:03:03.569
Yeah.

00:03:03.569 --> 00:03:05.380
H: Different colors and they're really big
and I, I touched its eye and its eye was like

00:03:05.380 --> 00:03:06.380
BWANG!

00:03:06.380 --> 00:03:08.290
It was really cool.

00:03:08.290 --> 00:03:12.170
K: So I really enjoyed meeting the slugs in
Washington.

00:03:12.170 --> 00:03:15.340
H: Yeah, and then our Washington friends were
like, "Yeah, they're slugs.

00:03:15.340 --> 00:03:16.340
They're gross.

00:03:16.340 --> 00:03:17.340
You step on them and it's gross."

00:03:17.340 --> 00:03:20.239
So it's beautiful here, so we're going to
go for a hike now.

00:03:20.239 --> 00:03:21.239
K: Yeah!

00:03:21.239 --> 00:03:22.239
Both: Yaaaay!

00:03:22.239 --> 00:03:23.239
H: Thanks for being married to me.

00:03:23.239 --> 00:03:25.950
K: Thank you for being married to me.

00:03:25.950 --> 00:03:26.959
I like it.

00:03:26.959 --> 00:03:28.469
H: John, we'll see you on Wednesday.

